rows.translation_en:
@From the front row, they pound
one enemy in the enemy front row.
From the back, they attack with flying kicks!!

@They're limited to medium armor,
but dodge so well that it's no problem!
Their equipment is cheap too. A bargain!

@This is a perfect opportunity! Write down your goals
for the year and stick them
somewhere you'll see them.

@When planning, weigh the present, a month ahead,
and a year ahead in roughly
a three-to-two-to-one ratio.

@That's about the right balance
between doing what's best right now
and thinking far into the future.

@When you're moving through a dungeon or cave,
look at the eight blue flames
that show your remaining time. If one is red...

@When that flame's turn comes, until it burns out,
the spinning oni treasure list
will be bursting with rare, valuable prizes!!

@You can send a copy of one family member
to another clan as an adoptee,
or welcome an adoptee into your own family.

@Bringing in another clan's blood
is an efficient way to make up for
traits the %@ clan lacks.

@Incidentally, you cannot return an adoptee
to their original clan
to make more copies of the same character.

@Equipment and secret arts do not transfer either!
Trying to find an exploit and cheat
is a waste of time. Ha ha!

@You cannot use Adoption during play.
Save and quit, then
select it from the title screen.

@Giving another clan a copy of a %@ clan deity,
or receiving a copy of another clan's deity,
is called Share Deity.

@Your friends kneeling and praying
to a deity of the [当家] clan!
It gives you a little feeling of superiority. Ha ha!

@You cannot use Share Deity during play.
Save and quit, then
select it from the title screen.

@It holds only thirty items.
Unnecessary things just get in the way.
And if an enemy steals them, it's a total loss...

@Take only the bare minimum of consumables.
Leave with space to spare and return full of treasure!
That's the ideal way to use your pack.

@If two or more party members
can use the same attack spell,
please try combining it.

@The spell takes a little longer to go off,
but the effect more than makes up for that delay
with a tremendous bang!

@The more people join in,
the bigger and bigger the effect!!
...It's truly amazing!

@When a man and woman from the %@ clan
and another clan join together and have a child,
it is called Soul Union.

@As the name suggests, this sacred ceremony
binds soul to soul.
Each person can do it only once in a lifetime.

@Both clans bear the curse,
so let's join hands
to fulfill our shared vow.

@You cannot use Soul Union during play.
Save and quit, then
select it from the title screen.

@Every sword Kenpuku forges
is a one-of-a-kind custom creation.
Of course, you can name it too.

@And the more you use it,
the sharper it supposedly gets!!
...Or so the rumors may or may not say.

@Apparently they're rather expensive, but why not try?
When you have some money to spare,
perhaps you could place an order.

@If a parent and child in the party
have mastered the same offensive secret art,
they can combine that art.

@Combining it across three generations,
parent, child, and grandchild, is even more amazing.
But please, watch everyone's Health carefully.

@Divine Union doesn't just
make your clan stronger.
The deities grow too.

@Each union improves the chosen deity's
genetic information, sometimes a lot,
but usually just a little.

@So if you keep choosing
your favorite deity for Divine Union,
their ranking in heaven might eventually change???
